+#### [Application-Tracking-System](https://github.com/KalyanM45/Application-Tracking-System)
+> **Description:** Despite the generic name, this repository is specifically an AI-powered resume evaluation tool built around Google Gemini and Streamlit. The README explains that it extracts PDF content, compares it to a job description, returns a percentage match, lists missing keywords, and produces a refined profile summary. It is not a full ATS, but it is useful for recruiters who want an auditable example of AI scoring logic in a small, forkable Python app. Its narrow scope also makes it easy to repurpose into internal hiring experiments.
+
+- **GitHub:** [github.com/KalyanM45/Application-Tracking-System](https://github.com/KalyanM45/Application-Tracking-System)
