+# Best AI Tools for Recruiters in 2026
+
+[![Awesome](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sindresorhus/awesome@main/media/badge.svg)](https://github.com/sindresorhus/awesome)
+[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)
+![Topics](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/GagnDeep/awesome-best-ai-tools-for-recruiters-2026?style=social)
+
+> Best AI tools for recruiters in 2026 increasingly means open-source software recruiters can inspect, self-host, and adapt to their own hiring workflows. This list focuses only on public GitHub repositories relevant to recruiting, ATS workflows, resume screening, candidate pipelines, and job-board operations, with GitHub metadata included for each project so teams can judge maturity, licensing, and maintenance before adopting anything.
+
+## Table of Contents
+- [TL;DR](#tldr)
+- [Why This List](#why-this-list)
+- [Open Source Tools](#open-source-tools)
